      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise individual clinicians and technicians for their reassuring bedside manner, thorough check-ups, and unhurried explanations. While most feedback is glowing, critical reviews mentioned an abrupt phone exchange and concerns regarding supervisory clinic handling."
