        "en": "Non-judgmental handling for anxious companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how gently the clinical team handles reactive dogs and nervous, spirited felines without judgment. Pet parents appreciate that staff take time to soothe pets in the exam room, though one reviewer reported observing rough handling in the treatment area."
      }
    },
